# Local secrets for the developer tools in Util/. Copy this file to `.env` in the repo root and fill in the
# values. `.env` is git-ignored: never commit it, paste it into an issue, or share a log that prints it.
# The Lua bot scripts never read this file; only the Node tools in Util/ do.

# Stratz API token (https://stratz.com): log in with Steam, open your account's API section and copy the
# token. Used by the item-build second opinion (Util/item-builds/, issue #38) for per-position item data.
# Optional: without it the report uses OpenDota (no key needed) and Dotabuff only.
STRATZ_TOKEN=
